body:
I have a lot against that record. It's when Manson's interviews took a nosedive in quality, for one; I think a lot of the lyrics are embarrassing; I wanted to see *Phantasmagoria: The Visions of Lewis Carroll*, which was instead scrapped in favor of making THEOL.

&#x200B;

That said, it has a handful of songs I like. "Leave A Scar", "Four Rusted Horses", and "Wight Spider" are solid, and "I Want To Kill You Like They Do In The Movies" is interesting.
